---
// A long form built up one block at a time.
---
<figure class="illus">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 180" role="img" aria-labelledby="tower-art-t">
    <title id="tower-art-t">A tower built from the bottom: 書く is a verb. The passive function makes 書かれる, still a verb. The neg function makes 書かれない, an い-adjective. The past function makes 書かれなかった, an い-adjective.</title>
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="20" y="6" width="170" height="38" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="105" y="25">書かれなかった</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="20" y="48" width="170" height="38" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="105" y="67">書かれない</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="20" y="90" width="170" height="38" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="105" y="109">書かれる</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="20" y="132" width="170" height="38" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="105" y="151">書く</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M200 25H214" /><path class="il-ah" d="M193 25l9-5.5v11z" />
    <path class="il-a" d="M200 67H214" /><path class="il-ah" d="M193 67l9-5.5v11z" />
    <path class="il-a" d="M200 109H214" /><path class="il-ah" d="M193 109l9-5.5v11z" />
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="224" y="25">past</text>
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="224" y="67">neg</text>
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="224" y="109">passive</text>
    <text class="il-s il-l" x="224" y="151">start</text>
    <rect class="il-pill type-i-adj" x="340" y="13" width="66" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-i-adj" x="373" y="25">い-adj</text>
    <rect class="il-pill type-i-adj" x="340" y="55" width="66" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-i-adj" x="373" y="67">い-adj</text>
    <rect class="il-pill type-verb" x="340" y="97" width="60" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-verb" x="370" y="109">verb</text>
    <rect class="il-pill type-verb" x="340" y="139" width="60" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-verb" x="370" y="151">verb</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Build from the bottom. Each block is a complete word that the next function can use.</figcaption>
</figure>
